# @coworkers/cw-utils is the shared Material UI theme the Daktela AI admin and
# the other addons use, so a configuration page built with it looks like part
# of the platform rather than a bolted-on page.
#
# It lives in a Google Artifact Registry that is readable **anonymously** - no
# login, no Daktela account. Everything else comes from public npm.
@coworkers:registry=https://europe-west3-npm.pkg.dev/artin-chatbot/cw-addons-npm/
